        {
          "sourceUnit": "shared.execution-grammar",
          "retainedUnit": "shared.execution-grammar.canonical",
          "field": "executionGrammar",
          "canonicalValue": "## 统一工具调用协议\nThese records are Bash HTTP tools, not native functions.\n- endpoint = family `origin` + full `path`; knowledge uses resource `url` + `path`.\n- Send JSON with only `requiredArgs`/`optionalArgs`; never send `forbiddenArgs`. Add every `requiredHeaders` entry using the family values below; memory/skill identity is session-injected.\n- `responseKind=json|dynamic-schema` uses `{code,message,data}` and succeeds only at code=0; `bytes` is raw.\ncanonical: `curl -sSk -X POST '<endpoint>' <headers> -d '<body>'`"
        }
